In order to solve the proposed task, this baseline must address the combined challenges of recognizing and rendering text at a pixel level, capturing the meaning of a sentence in a single vector as in early sequence-to-sequence models \cite{sutskever2014sequence}, and performing non-autoregressive translation \cite{gu2018nonautoregressive}. Although the model can sometimes produce the first few words of the output, it is unable to learn much beyond that; see Figure~\ref{fig:baseline-example} for a representative example.

